{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "df739ab3-f6a9-8962-b320-ed99440a257a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T13:25:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leo Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:21:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:21:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Yes, hello. My name is Leo Ricci. I am calling about water in the street, a puddle, but it is a big one and it does not go away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:22:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Ricci. Where is the puddle? What street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 432 Dixon Street, in the North End. Right in front of the house, more or less. It goes across half of the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:22:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Half the road, at 432 Dixon. Did we have rain recently that I'm forgetting about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. That is the thing. It has not rained since the weekend. Five days, almost. Everything else is dry, and this water just sits there. [pause] Como se diz... it is not right, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:22:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that doesn't sound right. Is it near a storm drain, a catch basin in the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:22:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there is one close to it, I think. But the water does not go in. It just stays, and in the morning it is a little bit of ice on the edge. The cars drive through and the water goes on the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:23:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So it could be a blocked drain, or something underground. Is the water clear, or does it look dirty or smell at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:23:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It looks a little brown, I would say. No smell that I notice. I have taken photographs with my phone. I can send them to you, if you have an email or a text."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:23:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll take a note that you have photos. Let me see how our crew likes to receive them. Hang on, don't go anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:23:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:23:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for holding. I don't have a good way to take photos on this line, but I'm putting in a service request now, and I'll note that you have pictures so the inspector can ask you for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is fine. And please, who do I call to have somebody check it? Is it you, or another office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:23:56-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called the right place. Public Works handles the drains and the street. I'm entering it, and a crew will go look at it. I can't tell you the exact day, but I'll mark that it's a dry-weather problem, because that tells them it's not just runoff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is important. It is not from a storm. Nothing. Just standing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:24:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me read it back. Standing water across half the road, in front of 432 Dixon Street, North End, near a catch basin, no rain since the weekend, caller has photos. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:24:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:24:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:24:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0179. But please, if they call, try not Thursday evening. On Thursdays I have the robotics team meeting, and it runs late. I do not hear the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:24:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'll put that in the notes, so no Thursday evening calls. That's 401-555-0179, Leo Ricci."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Thank you very much, Miss Lorraine. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. If it gets worse, or the ice builds up on the road, call us back. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:25:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
